'''Sàlàkọ́ Castañares''' is a [[Balisca|Baliscan]] politician currently serving as a member of the [[Confederal Congress]] and the incumbent [[Secretariat of Energy (Balisca)|Secretary of Energy]]. From April 2022 to March 2025 he served as the [[Deputy Secretary General of Balisca]]. 

He was elected in 2018 to represent the [[Jaçurumi (commune district)|Jaçurumi]] [[commune district]], and is aligned with the [[Revolutionary Workers' Front]]. 

